  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Please consider adding an option in Accessibility to disable certain features, or the nameplate customization entirely. Things such as animation can really make reading difficult for those visually impaired, especially around the movement. \n\nFor example the current testing profile customization has a shimmer/wave affect that goes into the \"About me\" section and is making it challenging to read the start of the text for me.\n\nI also need the opacity and high contrast to read names/pronouns etc. like the (now) older style of nameplates provided. Being able to see where my friends are in a group of a few people will become challenging if everyone has these new effects on their nameplates. \n\nThank you for your consideration.",
